    <id>tag:google.com,2016:gcp-release-notes#October_01_2026</id>
    <title>October 01, 2026</title>
    <updated>2026-10-01T00:00:00-07:00</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://cloud.google.com/release-notes#October_01_2026"/>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 class="release-note-product-title">Cloud Run</h2><h3 class="release-note-type-title">Feature</h3><p>Cloud Run now supports GPU-backed worker pools in <code>europe-west1</code>.</p><h2 class="release-note-product-title">BigQuery</h2><h3 class="release-note-type-title">Announcement</h3><p>BigQuery now supports vector search over partitioned tables.</p><h2 class="release-note-product-title">Cloud Storage</h2><h3 class="release-note-type-title">Change</h3><p>Soft delete is now on by default for new buckets.</p><h2 class="release-note-product-title">Cloud SQL</h2><p>Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL adds minor version 17.7.</p>]]></content>
  </entry>
